      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s4"
      },
      "text": "Jmidebs.sys 25552 14.07.2010 Presumably, Stuxnet Jmicron, unknown The first modification of the Stuxnet worm, created in 2009, used only one driver file - mrxcls.sys without a digital signature.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_10",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Evolution_Drivers_Duqu_Stuxnet",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s5"
      },
      "text": "In 2010, the authors created the second driver mrxnet.sys (to hide the worm's component files on USB drives) and equipped mrxnet.sys and mrxcls.sys drivers with digital certificates from Realtek.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_21",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Evolution_Drivers_Duqu_Stuxnet",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s5"
      },
      "text": "We managed to get a copy of the file, and we were amazed to find that it used the same Realtek certificate, but with a different file signing date from mrxcls.sys: rtniczw.sys was signed on 18 March 2010, while the mrxcls driver had been signed on 25 January of the same year.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_23",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Evolution_Drivers_Duqu_Stuxnet",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s2"
      },
      "text": "Stuxnet used the key \"MRxCls\" and the value \"Data\", while in the case of rtniczw.sys, the key was \"rtniczw\" and the value was \"Config\".",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_32",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Evolution_Drivers_Duqu_Stuxnet",
      "locator": {
        "page": 6,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p6_s3"
      },
      "text": "The file is named rndismpc.sys, it is 19,968 bytes in size, MD5",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_36",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Evolution_Drivers_Duqu_Stuxnet",
      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s1"
      },
      "text": "Like rtniczw.sys, the file rndismpc.sys had never been encountered on our users' machines.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
